<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 25,000 tonnes US corn - Trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 25,000 tonnes US corn - Trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought 25,000 tonnes of U.S. corn at $154.94 per tonne C&amp;F at a tender on Friday, traders said. They said shipment was for October 20-30.</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom - 2161-787538</p>
</text>
